<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Protective Life upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Protective Life upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Schroder Wertheim analyst Andrew Kligerman said he upgraded Protective Life Corp to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Cited strong management team, attractive stock valuation and potential for large, accretive acquisitions.</p>
<p>-- Said company may consider acquisitions above usual $30 million range.</p>
<p>-- Protective Life up 3/4 to 40</p>
</text>
